<title>DUBAI: Oman cuts February crude price to $19.72.</title>
<headline>Oman cuts February crude price to $19.72.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman has cut the price of its crude lifted in February by $2.78 to $19.72 a barrel, an Omani official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Oman has set its crude prices retroactively in line with international spot market developments.</p>
</text>
